reminder.en:
Hello {name}, a friendly reminder about your pledge to {event} on {date}.
You pledged {amount} and have paid {paid}; {balance} is still outstanding.
Pay to: {payment_number}
Treasurer: {treasurer} {treasurer_phone}
Thank you for your support!

reminder.lg:
Gyebale ko {name}! Tukujjukiza ku bweyamo bwo eri {event} nga {date}.
Weeyama {amount}, osasudde {paid}, osigazza {balance}.
Sasula ku: {payment_number}
Omuwanika: {treasurer} {treasurer_phone}
Webale nnyo okutuwagira!

reminder.sw:
Habari {name}, tunakukumbusha kwa upendo kuhusu ahadi yako kwa {event} tarehe {date}.
Uliahidi {amount} na umelipa {paid}; {balance} bado inasubiriwa.
Lipa kwa: {payment_number}
Mweka hazina: {treasurer} {treasurer_phone}
Asante kwa msaada wako!

invitation.en:
Hello {name}, you are warmly invited to support {event} on {date}.
Venue: {venue}
Pledge any amount and pay to:
{payment_details}
Thank you!

invitation.lg:
Gyebale ko {name}! Tukusaba otuwagire ku {event} nga {date}.
Wa: {venue}
Weeyame kyonna ky'osobola era osasule ku:
{payment_details}
Webale nnyo!

invitation.sw:
Habari {name}, unakaribishwa kwa upendo kuchangia {event} tarehe {date}.
Mahali: {venue}
Ahidi kiasi chochote na ulipe kwa:
{payment_details}
Asante!
